---
/**
 * src/components/ProjectCards.astro
 * Project Cards
 *
 * Author: Edward Silva
 * Creation Date: 07 November, 2026
 * Last Update: 09 November, 2026
 *
 * A row of project cards. A card shows a figure from the work when resume-data.json names one. An
 * SVG plot switches to its dark copy in dark mode. A photo fills the frame. A paper drawing blends
 * into the card.
 *
 * File Structure:
 * - Props: project pages
 * - Card with figure, title, and one line
 *
 * Where this file is used within the repository:
 * - src/pages/index.astro and src/pages/projects.astro
 *
 * Usage:
 * $ `npm run dev` : Renders in the local development server
